# Image names with no asset in the Client app, on purpose. One per line: <name><TAB><reason>.
# Read by missing_image_assets.py. The name is the asset name (the string), not the Swift constant.
# Each reason says why Ecosia's build never asks for the image; restore the imageset from the
# Firefox tag when that stops being true.
arrowTrendingLarge	trending searches, `trendingSearches` is off outside the developer channel (MOB-5309)
avatarWarningCircleFillMulticolorLargeDark	main menu account row, removed by Ecosia (MOB-5309)
avatarWarningCircleFillMulticolorLargeLight	main menu account row, removed by Ecosia (MOB-5309)
bookmarkTrayLarge	main menu Bookmarks row uses Ecosia's `bookmarksEmpty` instead (MOB-5309)
emailMaskLarge	Relay keyboard button, needs a Mozilla account and Ecosia has no sign-in (MOB-5309)
foxDefaultBrowser	main menu default-browser banner, a Firefox fox; Ecosia artwork needed, not this one (MOB-5309)
moreHorizontalRoundLarge	toolbar menu button uses Ecosia's `elipsis` instead (MOB-5309)
noBookmarksInFolder	bookmarks empty state is Ecosia's own view (MOB-5309)
noBookmarksInRoot	bookmarks empty state is Ecosia's own view (MOB-5309)
qrcode-scanBorder	QR scanner overlay; upstream nests the set inside lightningFillLarge.imageset, so actool skips it in Firefox 160.1 and on main too. Known gap, not fixed here (MOB-5309)
qrcode-scanLine	QR scanner overlay; upstream nests the set inside lightningFillLarge.imageset, so actool skips it in Firefox 160.1 and on main too. Known gap, not fixed here (MOB-5309)
securityError	native error page, `nativeErrorPage` is off on every channel (MOB-5309)
shieldCheckmarkLarge	homepage tracker blocker module, Ecosia's NTP never shows it (MOB-5309)
translateActive	restored by MOB-5282 on dc-mob-5282-qa-fixes; drop this line once that lands (MOB-5309)
